; The current page is placed by direct offsets, not fit_child_in_rect, so the mirror
; (control.cpp:1785-1787) puts the panel style's right margin on the left while the panel
; StyleBox, a plain draw call, stays. The lopsided 6/26 `panel` override and this ColorRect show it.
[node name="Page" type="ColorRect" parent="Rtl/Advanced"]
